<dl>
  <dt>News and Changes</dt>
    <dd>• [Stage View] Option to add the beginning of the next verse on the current slide;</dd>
    <dd>• [Triggers] Option to add an individual trigger for a playlist item or favorites bar. In other words, it allows adding actions (triggers) that will be executed automatically when running the main item;</dd>
    <dd>• [Countdown] Syntax that allows adding multiple texts that will be displayed according to the remaining countdown time;</dd>
    <dd>• [Display Settings] "Multiview" window that allows previewing multiple system screens (public, return, HTML, etc.) (Also available via plugin link);</dd>
    <dd>• When reordering by dragging a <b>Title</b> item in the media playlist, if it is collapsed, all "child" items will be moved together with the title as a block;</dd>
    <dd>• [Logo - Settings] Option to save and load Logo configuration (preset);</dd>
    <dd>• [Triggers] Option for triggers when starting and ending the program;</dd>
    <dd>• [Triggers] New "source" rule, which makes it easier to create a trigger that works for any item except a specific one;</dd>
    <dd>• Setting to add a delay (execution delay) to a Trigger and to a favorites bar item (right mouse button);</dd>
    <dd>• [Automatic Presentation] Option to select "next presentation" that will be executed automatically when an auto presentation ends;</dd>
    <dd>• [Automatic Presentation] When selecting and running multiple Automatic Presentation items in the service/event list using the right mouse button, the items will be executed sequentially one after another, using the recent "next presentation" implementation;</dd>
    <dd>• [MIDI] Option to sync VLC Player with MIDI Time Code;</dd>
    <dd>• [Bible Window] Setting to fix the number of columns in the chapters and verses grid (Bible window settings button, layout tab);</dd>
    <dd>• [Bible Window] Setting to increase the width of the verse list (right mouse button on the verse list, settings submenu, "width" option);</dd>
    <dd>• [Settings - Clock - Wallpaper] Setting to fine-tune the exact position of the clock on the wallpaper;</dd>
    <dd>• [Display Settings] Option to rename the respective HTML tabs in the display settings;</dd>
    <dd>• [Display Settings] Option to hide specific presentation types for physical outputs, similar to HTML outputs;</dd>
    <dd>• Option to define the alignment of the verse reference (when at the top or bottom) independently from the alignment defined in the Theme;</dd>
    <dd>• New item type (for playlist or favorites bar) that allows selecting a background from the "my videos" tab for display;</dd>
    <dd>• [Interface] Multiple languages available for the program interface, automatically translated using AI;</dd>
    <dd>&nbsp;</dd>

  <dt>Bug Fixes</dt>
    <dd>• Issue restoring component widths when restarting the program;</dd>
    <dd>• Automatic Presentation does not update the global BPM value;</dd>
    <dd>• The verse from the third Bible version when displaying 3 versions simultaneously does not apply the "split long verses" option when enabled;</dd>
    <dd>• Other fixes and performance improvements...</dd>
</dl>